G-Player downloads, but does not include, these third-party components at run time:
  - Wine Staging for macOS (LGPL-2.1+), built by Gcenx: https://github.com/Gcenx/macOS_Wine_builds
  - DXVK for macOS (zlib), by Gcenx: https://github.com/Gcenx/DXVK-macOS
